# The Wi-Fi attendant without wireless (no-wireless rule): the Wi-Fi functions read as no Wi-Fi data (logged), the
# challenge's picks and save go through, then the connection (BT_FUNC_UNK_16) ends as a failed one: the attendant says
# goodbye and the Communication Club flag is cleared, as after any ended challenge.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 60 platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE platinum:MOVE_DRAGON_CLAW
party 1 platinum:SPECIES_LUCARIO 55 platinum:MOVE_AURA_SPHERE
party 2 platinum:SPECIES_STARAPTOR 52 platinum:MOVE_BRAVE_BIRD
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_BATTLE_TOWER 19 6 up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until menu 600
+10 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until app party 600
+2 tap slot:0
+2 tap menu:0
+2 tap slot:1
+2 tap menu:0
+2 tap slot:2
+2 tap menu:0
+2 tap confirm
until app none 300
advance text
until yesno 600
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until yesno 600
+2 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
until idle 600
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_COMMUNICATION_CLUB_ACCESSIBLE false
